ng important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn8le02ob01re7pdf01.pdf"}]}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Write a paragraph recommending a restaurant you like."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le02ob01re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le02ob01re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le02ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le02ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Good evening. How many people are in your party? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: One other person is meeting me here. Her office closes late this week.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So for two then. Do you have a reservation?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: Of course. It's for Brown. Edmund Brown.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Could I suggest a table by the window?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: That goes without saying.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Okay. I'm going to seat you here. I'll bring you the menus. Would you like the wine list as well? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span> : Certainly."}, {"time": "23500", "image": "engenn8le02ob01re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Here you go sir. Could I recommend the house wine?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: Definitely not. We're celebrating tonight. I'll choose something. I'm going to propose. I'm going to put the ring in the wine. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I wouldn't recommend that sir. Whenever the ring is in the wine or inside the cake, it often gets swallowed! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: That stands to reason. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'd suggest the old-fashioned way.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: Hmm."}, {"time": "45500", "image": "engenn8le02ob01re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll tell you the specials for tonight. We're serving orange glazed duck with green beans almandine. There's also grilled rainbow trout with asparagus.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: Thank you. I'm not going to choose until Miranda arrives. She's coming in about 10 minutes. However, I'll have a bottle of this Chardonnay.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll bring your wine. Is your date expecting you to be seated?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: Hmm ... maybe not.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll watch out for her then. I'm on the door all evening."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa and the Customer Complaint"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "May I Take Your Order? "}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Exchange information using a wider range of language."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Think of a restaurant you have gone to."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe some of the food and drink on the menu."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph recommending the restaurant to a friend."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say in the paragraph when you plan to go there again."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the paragraph aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " I talk about food and drink."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a paragraph to recommend a restaurant I have been to."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I say when I am going to go there again."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share the paragraph with someone."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Offering Service and Help"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you offer service and help to customers, remember to be polite. The modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span> and <span class=\"italic\">would </span> are used to make an offer or invite someone to do something.<br/>You can respond to a requests using the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span> and <span class=\"italic\">would </span>to suggest something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you respond to an offer of service or help, you should answer politely. However, this does not always happen."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Offer Service or Help</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Respond to Offers</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could I suggest a table by the window?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That goes without saying.</span><br/>(not polite)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could I recommend the house wine?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Definitely not.</span><br/>(not polite)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wouldn't recommend that, sir.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That stands to reason.</span><br/>(polite)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'd suggest the old-fashioned way.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That stands to reason. </span><br/> (polite)\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Future With <span class=\"italic\">Will</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Going to</span>, the Present Continuous"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use three different tenses to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about a things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">be going to</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Deciding Now</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'll bring you the menus.<br/>I'll choose something.<br/>I'll tell you the specials for tonight.<br/>However, I'll have a bottle of this Chardonnay.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Intentions</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm going to seat you here.<br/>I'm going to propose.<br/>I'm going to put the ring in the wine.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Plans / Things On the Agenda</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">One other person is meeting me here.<br/>We're celebrating tonight.<br/>She's coming in about 10 minutes.<br/>Is your date expecting you to be seated?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "party"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "group of people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How many people are in your party?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le02ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you work at a restaurant."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wine list"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a menu for wine in a restaurant"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Would you like the wine list as well? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le02ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "house wine"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "wine bought in bulk by a restaurant"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Could I recommend the house wine?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le02ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to propose"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to ask someone to be your spouse"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm going to propose tonight."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le02ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "whenever"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "every time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(conjunction)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Whenever the ring is in the wine, it gets swallowed!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le02ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to swallow"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to put down your throat when you eat or drink"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Swallow the pills with some water."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le02ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "glazed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "cooked with a liquid brushed on it so it becomes shiny "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The duck is glazed with an orange sauce."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le02ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "almandine"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "with almonds"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We're serving green beans almandine tonight."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le02ob01aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "trout"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a fish that lives in rivers and lakes "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There's also grilled rainbow trout."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le02ob01aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "asparagus"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a tall spear-like green vegetable"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We serve fresh asparagus with the meal."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le02ob01aud10"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn8le02ob01re1img01.jpg"}]}